    {
      "id": "control",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Context & Membrane\nDecision: What boundary applies, who and what may cross it, and which evidence and authority govern the crossing?\nOwns: Context identity, boundary, actors, permissions, exclusions and membrane crossing rules.\nExcludes: Service definition, Method steps, canonical state, Benefit claim, Asset maturity, Work Object priority or runtime execution.\nOpen HTML: [[00_SYSTEM/NAVIGATOR_SUPPORT/CURRENT/COMPONENTS/ELEMENT_CONTEXT_MEMBRANE_v1.2.html]]\nReturn: [[00_HOME]]\nPPV: Potential | Authority: HELD for operational mutation | Replay: PRESERVED",
